BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5dbcd270ec2ba6fef44d0304e6c43b53acdce421@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261017T154538Z
DTSTART:20261017T164500Z
DTEND:20261017T184500Z
SUMMARY:Coyote vs. Acme
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:45pm\, 3pm\, 5:15pm\, 7:30pm\nAfter decades of being 
 blown to bits by bombs\, demolished by dynamite\, mangled by magnets\, bat
 tered by boulders\, trampled by trains\, tricked by tunnels\, sprung by sp
 rings\, steamrolled by steamrollers\, maligned by misfires\, bedeviled by 
 bungees\, rattled by rockets\, backstabbed by bat suits\, rocked by rocket
  skates\, upended by unicycles\, quaked by quake pills\, rubberized by rog
 ue bands\, and hurled headlong off every cliff in the Southwest\, Wile E. 
 Coyote (Genius) finally fights back. Teaming up with billboard accident la
 wyer Kevin Avery (Will Forte)\, he takes on slick corporate counsel Buddy 
 Crane (John Cena) and ACME\, Inc.\, the profit-obsessed conglomerate behin
 d every one of the Coyote’s chaotic catastrophes.\nhttps://www.westnewto
 ncinema.com/movie/coyote-vs-acme\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.cit
 y/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/coyote-vs-acme
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
