DTSTART:20261017T170000Z
DTEND:20261017T190000Z
SUMMARY:Digger
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 7pm\nThe most powerful man in the world embarks on
  a frantic mission to prove he is humanity's saviour before the disaster h
 e’s unleashed destroys everything.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/mov
 ie/digger\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/digger
END:VEVENT
